      "message": "psbt: drop Taproot and MuSig2 signatures when adding an input\n\nPartiallySignedTransaction::AddInput clears partial_sigs, final_script_sig\nand final_script_witness because adding an input changes the transaction,\nbut kept the Taproot key and script signatures and the MuSig2 nonces and\npartial signatures. joinpsbts therefore returned inputs that carried\nsignatures for a different transaction.",
